        {
            "id": "6c66f9d5-d3cd-40f3-807f-e19f5a867b9f",
            "type": "sourceText",
            "position": {
                "x": 860,
                "y": -360
            },
            "size": {
                "width": 320,
                "height": 280
            },
            "config": {
                "text": "Mobile game UI/UX design, pre-level start screen, pop-up modal window for a premium casual word puzzle game. Juicy 3D, warm and rich art style.\n\nBackground: A rich, warm, magical library with dark wooden bookshelves, glowing golden sunlight, and soft depth of field (blurred). Maintain the deep, inviting atmosphere of a premium game, do NOT overexpose the background.\n\nTop HUD: Full HUD visible above the window. A round player avatar on the left. Horizontal, pill-shaped panels made of light beige parchment with thin brown borders for: Gold coins with a green \"+\", Hearts, and Stars. A glossy blue gear icon on the far right.\n\nThe Pop-up Window: A simple, elegant light-wooden frame with a warm beige parchment interior (matching the flat Scrabble-like board game). No dark ornate carvings.\nTop of the window: a glowing 3D text \"LEVEL 45\" on a small wooden banner.\n\nCenter: A 2x2 grid of 4 distinct objective slots. Each slot is a small parchment panel containing a tiny 3D icon (like a wooden letter tile, a star, a book, or a magic wand) and a bright green checkmark.\n\nBelow the objectives: 3 square booster slots with warm wooden tiles and colorful 3D icons (bomb, magnet, shuffle).\n\nBottom Button: A massive, highly glossy, translucent AMBER-colored \"PLAY\" button at the bottom of the window.\n\nA cute, volumetric 3D mascot owl is peeking from the top right edge of the window.\n\nHigh contrast, vibrant but soft colors, light wood, rich background, clean layout, 8k --ar 9:16 --no washed out colors, overexposed background, dark ornate wood, missing UI elements",
                "sourceName": ""
            },
            "inputs": [],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "id": "a17fbb89-2fe3-4c9e-ae6e-ab0949142894",
                    "name": "out",
                    "type": "text"
                }
            ]
        },
