        {
            "id": "3e80e8c1-9e51-49b1-92e2-76f8c4f0e45d",
            "type": "sourceText",
            "position": {
                "x": 1740,
                "y": -360
            },
            "size": {
                "width": 320,
                "height": 260
            },
            "config": {
                "text": "Mobile game UI/UX design, level victory screen, pop-up modal window. Premium casual game, Royal Match art style.\n\nTop HUD (Above the window): Round player avatar on the left. Horizontal pill-shaped panels with visible text numbers inside: Gold coins with \"13,010\" and a green plus button, Hearts with \"5\", Stars with \"120\". A blue gear icon on the right.\n\nThe Pop-up Window: A massive, thick, chunky light-wood frame with highly rounded corners. Interior: light beige parchment texture. Top: thick wooden banner \"LEVEL 45\". Glossy red \"X\" button.\n\nCenter Area:\nBackground: Radiant golden sunburst rays and subtle confetti.\nTop text: Thick, 3D golden text \"VICTORY!\".\nDecor: Three small 3D wooden letter tiles with the letters \"A\", \"O\", and \"E\" placed neatly in the corners of the parchment (top left, bottom left, top right). They must be perfectly aligned and NOT floating randomly.\nHero Element: A large, clean number \"63\". It is designed as a clean game UI font with a golden gradient and dark outline, but it has a subtle 3D bevel and inner shadow so it matches the 3D style of the UI, while remaining perfectly readable.\nBase: The number rests on a large, plush crimson velvet cushion. Next to it is a neat, tall stack of polished gold coins.\n\nAction Buttons: Two large, thick, glossy 3D buttons side-by-side. 1. Left: Emerald green \"CONTINUE\". 2. Right: Amber-orange with a video icon, text \"315 COINS\", and an integrated orange \"x2\" badge.\n\nCharacters: A cute, volumetric 3D toy-like owl mascot (wearing small aviator goggles) is peeking over the top right edge.\n\nBottom: Integrated horizontal banner for \"Season Pass\".\n\nCinematic lighting, strong visual hierarchy, clean UI layout, 8k --ar 9:16 --no empty UI panels, floating letters, completely flat numbers, heavy plastic numbers",
                "sourceName": ""
            },
            "inputs": [],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "id": "de8453d1-6812-494c-b898-5d81214ca658",
                    "name": "out",
                    "type": "text"
                }
            ]
        },
