            "config": {
                "text": "Mobile game UI/UX design, level failed screen, pop-up modal window for a premium casual word puzzle game. Juicy 3D, warm and rich art style.\n\nBackground: A blurred, slightly dimmed magical library with dark wooden bookshelves to create a dramatic mood.\n\nThe Main Pop-up Window: A large, thick panel with a light-wooden frame and a rich purple/blue gradient interior.\nTop: Bold 3D text \"CONTINUE?\" centered. A glossy red circular \"X\" close button in the top right corner.\n\nCenter Panel: Below the title, an inset beige parchment panel with metallic studs in the corners.\nInside this panel, a horizontal layout: on the left is a glossy blue ribbon banner featuring a large golden text \"+5\". On the right, next to the ribbon, there is a horizontal row of 3 empty square UI slots (wooden frames with a parchment background) designed for showing boosters. Below this row, the text \"Add 5 moves and continue!\".\n\nAction Buttons: Exactly TWO large horizontal glossy buttons side-by-side at the bottom of the pop-up.\n\nLeft button: Bright green, with a gold coin icon and the text \"900\".\n\nRight button: Amber-orange, with a blue video play icon and the text \"PLAY FOR AD\".\n\nBottom Banner: At the very bottom of the screen, a horizontal promo banner for the \"Season Pass\" featuring a golden ticket and small 3D chests.\n\nHigh contrast, vibrant colors, light wood, purple and blue accents, rich background, clean layout, 8k --ar 9:16 --no three stacked buttons, washed out colors, overexposed background, dark ornate wood, realistic animals",
                "sourceName": ""
            },
