            "size": {
                "width": 320,
                "height": 240
            },
            "config": {
                "text": "Mobile game UI/UX design, shop screen for a premium casual word puzzle game. Royal Match art style, rich 3D render.\n\nBackground: A rich, warm, heavily blurred magical library with golden bokeh.\n\nTop HUD: Round player avatar, gold coin counter, gem counter, blue gear icon.\n\nLayout:\nTop Section (Special Offers): A large horizontal wooden banner featuring a special deal: a pile of massive gold coins, shiny blue gems, and a glowing amber booster. On the right, a bright green glossy button \"899 RUB\".\nBottom Section (Standard Packs): A grid of 3 smaller parchment cards. Each card has a thick wooden frame and shows a pile of gold coins (1000, 2000, 5000). Below each card is a green glossy button with a price tag.\n\nTheme Elements: Thick light-wood borders, beige parchment textures, magical sparkling dust. A cute 3D owl mascot is peeking from the top right corner, holding a gold coin.\n\nCinematic lighting, premium UI, clean layout, 8k --ar 9:16 --no flat vector style, empty panels, messy piles of coins, dark shadows",
                "sourceName": ""
            },
            "inputs": [],
            "outputs": [
